  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "PostgreSQL Database Status",
      "items": [
        "Status: NON-EXISTENT / NO DATABASE CONNECTED YET",
        "The 20 tables above are fully designed in docs/data-architecture.md",
        "Data flows from Ingestion (source_event_stream, status_mapping) into Rules Engine and Incidents once connected."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Ingestion to Schema Dataflow",
      "items": [
        "1. Raw WebSocket / API events land in `source_event_stream` (JSONB).",
        "2. Status changes are mapped via `status_mapping` priority table.",
        "3. Rules Engine evaluates state against `rules_master` and `rule_version`.",
        "4. Violations trigger `monitoring_instance` and `incident_log`, dispatching notifications via `notification_log`."
      ]
    }
